{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521220/extras/1050a391f0b6b352b29ecd41aeffe849.avif?t=1774068895\" width=616 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aliens are attacking Earth. You pilot a ship built out of nanobots that can evolve to defeat anything that the invaders can throw at you. Defeat the waves of alien ships and push the war all the way back to their home world to ensure the safety of the human race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521220/extras/ceeeb3d110c5fe7347d2559a0e6caa48.poster.avif?t=1774068895\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521220/extras/ceeeb3d110c5fe7347d2559a0e6caa48.webm?t=1774068895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521220/extras/ceeeb3d110c5fe7347d2559a0e6caa48.mp4?t=1774068895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Momentum-based ship movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-firing weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim your shields to defend against incoming fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect nanobots dropped by enemies to evolve your ship</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3521220?t=1774068895","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521220/f732ad13d6d0ab4ffeef2e4f1f28ea5185530327/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774068895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521220/a185c8493559a880fa3a30